Key KPIs to be analysed (Cards)
- Total sales
- Total orders
- Total customers
- Average Order Value
- Total discount
- Total shipping cost

Filters
- Region
- Category
- Date

Key Visuals
- Amount by store type (Pie Chart)
- Amount by region and year (Line chart)
- Regionwise amount (Clustered bar chart)
- Amount by program tier (Donut chart)
- Amount by age group (Bar chart or Funnel chart)
- Amount by category (Tree map)

Measures
- Total Order Amount - sum(orderamount)
- Total Orders - count(orderid)
- Total Discount Amount - sum(discountamount)
- Total Shipping Cost - sum(shippingcost)
- Average Order Value - avg(orderamount)
- Total Customers - count(customerid)

Calculated Columns
- age = datediff(dimcustomer[DOB], today(), year)
- age grouping = if (dimcustomer[age] < 18, 'Minor',
                 if (dimcustomer[age] >= 18 && dimcustomer[age] < 25, 'Between 18 and 24',
                 if (dimcustomer[age] >= 25 && dimcustomer[age] < 34, 'Between 25 and 34',
                 if (dimcustomer[age] >= 35 && dimcustomer[age] < 44, 'Between 35 and 44',
                 if (dimcustomer[age] >= 45 && dimcustomer[age] < 54, 'Between 45 and 54',
                 if (dimcustomer[age] >= 55 && dimcustomer[age] < 64, 'Between 55 and 64', '65 and above'))))))

Dashboard
Section 1 - header, logo, filters
Section 2 - key metric cards
Section 3 - amount segregation by store type, timeseries and region
Section 4 - amount segregation by program tier age group and category

Theme - Accessible Tidal (Power Bi)
